<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Settings screen strings. Arabic is the default locale: this is the unqualified `values/` folder,
  so every user gets these unless their device asks for another language. The complete English
  translation lives in `values-en/`.

  Keys are prefixed `settings_` so a grep for the screen's strings never turns up another module's.
  Labels here are deliberately short: the segmented rows give every option an equal share of one
  line and clip rather than wrap, so a label that reads well on its own may still be too long to
  select.
-->
